{"articleNo":"2362","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2362&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009학년도 동계방학 오름관 입관 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.11.13","hit":"16575","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><!--StartFragment--></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2009년도 동계방학 오름관 입관 신청 안내</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"635\" bgcolor=\"#ffccff\" height=\"55\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">오름관 입사를 희망하는 학생은 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">신청전에</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> 학적부의 연락처를 변경하여 등록에 관한 안내사항(문자)을 받을 수 있도록 협조 바람.(집전화➡휴대폰으로 수정)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><!--StartFragment--><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.5pt\">2009학년도 동</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.5pt\">계방학 기간동안 오름관 입사를 희망하는 재학생(휴학생 제외)은 다음과 같이 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span>\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">❍</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\"> 개사기간 : 2009. 12. 21(월) ~ 2010. 2. 19(금)(61일간)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">❍</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">신청기간 : 2009. 11. 23(월) 10:00 ~ 2009. 11. 25(수) 17:00까지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">❍</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\"> 신청장소 : 인터넷 접수(www.kumoh.ac.kr → 원스톱서비스)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">❍</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.5pt\">합격자 발표 : 2009. 11. 27(금) 10:00 홈페이지 원스톱서비스에 선발 확인</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -2.2pt\">선발 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -2.2pt\">확인 후 오름관비 납입고지서를 출력하여 아래의 납부기간 내에 오름관비를 납부하시기 바랍니다 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">❍</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"> 오름관비 납부 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;‣ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.7pt\">전 기간 입사자 : 484,600원(관리비＋식비)(입사일 조식, 신정, 구정, 퇴사일 석식 미제공)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;‣ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">납부기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.8pt\">2009. 11. 30(월) 10:00 ~ 2009. 12. 3(목) 은행 마감시간까지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;‣ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -2.1pt\">납부장소 : 농협중앙회 전국지점(단위농협 포함) 및 본교 농협(글로벌관 128호)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">❍</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">선발 인원 : 310명(남학생 : 186명, 여학생 : 124명) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">❍</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\"> 입사시 준비물 : 사진 2매(3× 4㎝), 신분증 지참, 세면도구, 개인침구류</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">❍</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\"> 문의 전화 : (054) 478-7941/7942</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">❍ 학년과 성적에 관계 없이 선착순으로 선발 합니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">❍ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">공식적인 행사이외에는 환불이 불가하오니 신중한 신청 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2009. 11. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">금오공과대학교 생활관장</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
